  "description": "This Vamoose Mammoth 500 ST (step-through) is an AWD electric bicycle that comes with dual 52V 500W motors (front and rear), a torque sensor, RST Forks, and optional dual-battery capability.Mammoth 500 ST - AWD STEP THROUGH!This Vamoose Mammoth 500 ST AWD electric bicycle comes with dual 52V 500W motors (front and rear), a torque sensor, RST Forks, and optional dual-battery capability, providing exceptional power and torque for mudslinging or crushing fresh powder!\n\nA commanding machine, the Mammoth comes standard with a truly mammoth 52V 20Ah battery producing an incredible 1040 Watt-hours of performance - a +84 km range! But better still, you can add an extra 52V 15Ah battery to take it up to 150 km!This cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• Dual 52V 500W motors\n\n• 52V 20 Ah Samsung Battery with additional battery optional\n\n• A 6061 aircraft aluminum frame with alloy front forks\n\n• 26\" x 4.8” Fat Tires\n\n26\" x 4.8\" MAXXIS MINION FBR FBF\n\nRear, with front mount option\n\n4-6 hrs.\n\n166 x 34 x 86.5\n\n65 X 13 X 34\n\n41kg NW / 51 kg GW\n\n90 lbs NW / 113 lbs GW\n\n330 lbs.",
